ted.\n\nIt seems that Godot somehow fails to tell the GPU in the exclusive full screen mode that vsync should be used.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- show fps in the game UI\n- run game from editor, from executable, in windowed mode and in exclusive full screen moe\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108678/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}